{"id":"u-42dfca66-7946-4de9-8139-7da3e36339e3","src":"community","title":"Titan – 12 Week Bodybuilding Hypertrophy Program","author":"Yin","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/X1B3ei-titan-12-week-bodybuilding-hypertrophy-program","desc":"Project Titan is a 12-week bodybuilding hypertrophy program designed for experienced lifters whose primary goal is to build a balanced, muscular physique while improving overall strength and conditioning. The program emphasizes progressive overload, high-quality training volume, and strategic recovery to maximize muscle growth without sacrificing athletic performance.\n\nSpecial focus is placed on bringing up the lower body through twice-weekly leg training while maintaining and refining upper-body development. Compound movements build strength, while targeted isolation work develops muscle size, symmetry, and definition.\n\nThis program incorporates structured progression using RIR (Reps in Reserve), daily low-intensity cardio to support cardiovascular health and body composition, and scheduled deloads to manage fatigue and ensure consistent progress over the full 12 weeks.\n\nWhether your goal is to step on a bodybuilding stage or simply build a physique that reflects years of disciplined training, Project Titan provides a structured roadmap to become bigger, stronger, and more proportionate while maintaining long-term performance and recovery.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle","Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-24T19:22:03.229Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Lower A (Strength/Quads)","Push A","Pull A","Lower B","Upper Power","Delts & Arms Specialization"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":8,"x":5}]},{"n":"Squat (Paused)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":3}],"note":"2 second pause"},{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}],"note":"Slow eccentric"},{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}],"note